Hi!

UltraPenguin 1.0.9 has new glibc RPMs, which include the fixed version of
longjmp, so that you can try your threaded apps (e.g. Mozilla).
The RPMS are glibc-2.0.7-11*.rpm at
ftp://ultra.linux.cz/OS/Linux/Sparc/local/ultrapenguin-1.0.9/...
and should be hopefully soon available from a couple of mirrors as well.

